OL,3,AFamily 'heartbroken' after mother and
OL,4,Athree children died in fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe statement added that "Elisha was a
OL,7,Fdevoted and loving mother" and "our
OL,8,Fbeautiful babies, Leo, Ellis and
OL,9,FPrudence, were loved beyond measure".
